Package: africanUrbanGrowthReview
Title: African Urban Growth Research — Systematic Review Analysis
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alvin", "Adu-Asare", , "alvinkofiaduasare@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ayyoob", "Sharifi", role = "aut"))
Description: Analytical pipeline for a PRISMA-compliant systematic review of
    African urban growth research 2015-2025 (n = 183 studies).  Reproduces every
    figure, table and statistical test reported in the companion Nature Cities
    manuscript, plus the exploratory analyses performed during the review.
    Tracks corpus v9 (urban_abstracts_reviewed_updated_new_9.xlsm).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    tidyverse (>= 2.0.0),
    scales,
    knitr,
    kableExtra,
    broom,
    car,
    rstatix,
    effectsize,
    corrplot,
    sf,
    rnaturalearth,
    rnaturalearthdata,
    viridis,
    RColorBrewer,
    ggrepel,
    rmarkdown
Suggests:
    renv,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.9) with openpyxl, to rebuild the dataset from the raw corpus
